<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KFA buys 22,000 T of wheat bran - traders.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KFA buys 22,000 T of wheat bran - traders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Korea Feed Association (KFA) bought 22,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellet for arrival on December 20, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
